**run-comp dispatch (comp_runner.py, confirmed):**
- Contains P (with or without F) → olivine prototype (Pnma, LiFePO₄ coords)
- TM count sum = 2 (M₂O₄) → spinel prototype (Fd-3m, LiMn₂O₄ coords)
- Else → layered R-3m NMC811 prototype
- CHGNet relax (full + x_Li=0.3 delithiated), avg voltage vs Li metal, capacity = 0.7·F/mw, rel_stability vs NMC811 baseline.
